45	/// A trivial fake — this router-focused suite only needs
46	/// `MeusRegistrosScreen`'s/`EntryDetailScreen`'s own `GoRoute.builder`s to
47	/// resolve `sl<MeusRegistrosCubit>()`/`sl<EntryDetailCubit>()` without
