49	/// already cover each cubit's own behavior against a more capable fake.
50	/// `list()` always resolves to an empty page so `MeusRegistrosScreen`
51	/// settles on its plain "no entries yet" state instead of hanging;
52	/// `getById()` always resolves to a trivial [Entry] with the requested
53	/// [id] so `EntryDetailScreen` settles on its own `EntryDetailData` state.
